{"id":"multitud","lemma":"multitud","pos":"noun","rank":2340,"glosses":["multitude","crowd","a lot, loads"],"ipa":"/multiˈtud/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"multitudes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-multitud.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿De dónde viene esta multitud?","en":"Where'd all these people come from?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788604","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Había una gran multitud ahí.","en":"There was a large crowd there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582427","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Me sé multitud de canciones.","en":"I know lots of songs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454921","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"song","l":"canción"}]},{"text":"Estaba perdido entre la multitud.","en":"I was lost in the crowd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639560","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"between"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Dos son compañía, tres son multitud.","en":"Two's company, three's a crowd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594305","words":[{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"company"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}